WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.268
Attackers' AI agents found an

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.238
unknown bug in medical imaging

00:00:04.038 --> 00:00:05.981
software, then used it to

00:00:05.781 --> 00:00:06.512
get root.

00:00:07.212 --> 00:00:09.179
Amazon says the agents took

00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:10.869
about eleven minutes to go

00:00:10.669 --> 00:00:12.329
from mapping the API to

00:00:12.129 --> 00:00:13.404
writing any file.

00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:16.449
The target helps researchers annotate

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:17.283
medical scans.

00:00:17.323 --> 00:00:19.327
Its uploads never check where

00:00:19.127 --> 00:00:20.915
files land, and login is

00:00:20.715 --> 00:00:21.781
off by default.

00:00:22.331 --> 00:00:24.485
Amazon found it by accident:

00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:26.891
the attackers' own agent framework,

00:00:26.691 --> 00:00:28.996
Cairn, was online with no login.

00:00:29.036 --> 00:00:30.955
Every agent step was readable.

00:00:31.505 --> 00:00:33.109
The agents hid a reverse

00:00:32.909 --> 00:00:34.379
shell in a file Python

00:00:34.179 --> 00:00:35.315
loads at startup.

00:00:35.355 --> 00:00:37.493
A training call launched Python,

00:00:37.293 --> 00:00:38.494
which ran it as root.

00:00:39.044 --> 00:00:41.004
The failures are the scarier part.

00:00:41.044 --> 00:00:42.893
One run spent sixteen hours

00:00:42.693 --> 00:00:44.184
on a single database.

00:00:44.224 --> 00:00:46.278
Another tried over thirty thousand

00:00:46.078 --> 00:00:47.513
password combinations.

00:00:47.553 --> 00:00:48.741
Nothing landed.

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.047
Humans get bored and sleep.

00:00:51.087 --> 00:00:52.813
These agents keep going,

00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:53.941
and they only need to

00:00:53.741 --> 00:00:54.405
win once.

00:00:54.955 --> 00:00:56.945
The advisory came out November

00:00:56.745 --> 00:00:58.666
eighteenth, but the fix was

00:00:58.466 --> 00:01:01.007
not installable until the twenty-second.

00:01:01.047 --> 00:01:02.979
Federal agencies must act by

00:01:02.779 --> 00:01:04.350
November twenty-sixth.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.417
If your lab runs it,

00:01:06.217 --> 00:01:08.100
upgrade to zero point eight

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:08.685
point six.

00:01:08.725 --> 00:01:09.851
Turn on login,

00:01:09.651 --> 00:01:11.373
take it off the internet,

00:01:11.173 --> 00:01:12.829
and hunt for strange files.

00:01:13.379 --> 00:01:14.866
The bug was not clever.

00:01:14.906 --> 00:01:17.101
Cheap, tireless agents are built

00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:18.763
to work through exactly these

00:01:18.563 --> 00:01:19.693
forgotten flaws.

